OL,3,AThick fog disrupts morning travel as
OL,4,Ayellow weather warnings in effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FYellow weather warnings for dense fog
OL,7,Fare in effect across parts of the UK as
OL,8,Flow visibility threatens to disrupt
OL,9,Ftravel on Monday morning.
OL,11,FThe Met Office has issued a yellow
OL,12,Fwarning across much of England and
OL,13,Feastern Wales running until 11:00 GMT
OL,14,Fon Monday. An additional fog warning
OL,15,Fhas been issued for Northern Ireland
OL,16,Frunning until 10:00 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
