OL,3,AAt least 34 dead after Europe-bound
OL,4,Amigrant boat sinks off Senegal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 34 people have died after a
OL,7,Fboat carrying migrants sank off the
OL,8,Fcoast of Senegal, the Senegalese Press
OL,9,FAgency (APS) reports, citing an
OL,10,Fofficial source.
OL,12,FThe Interior ministry said one person
OL,13,Fhad been rescued, but the number of
OL,14,Fpeople still missing was yet to be
OL,15,Festablished.
OL,17,FThe small wooden boat capsized between
OL,18,Fthe capital, Dakar and the northern
OL,19,Fcity of Saint-Louis, as it headed
OL,20,Ftowards Spain's Canary Islands.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
